stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> active : spawn admitted, suffix prefilled
    active --> awaiting_tool : stop token, policy says tool_call
    awaiting_tool --> active : result, nudge or recovery prompt admitted
    active --> idle : returned, or dropped and recovered
    awaiting_tool --> idle : dropped at the stall-break and recovered
    idle --> disposed : next observe prunes the branch
    disposed --> [*]
    note right of active
        in the decode set every tick
        unless a verdict removes it
    end note
    note right of awaiting_tool
        costs nothing, decides nothing,
        until admission re-activates it
    end note
